{"seq":3,"slug":"redux-toolkit","title":"Redux Toolkit 状态管理工具集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/redux-toolkit","wordCount":580,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"redux-toolkit-状态管理工具集\">Redux Toolkit 状态管理工具集</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Redux Toolkit（RTK）是 Redux 官方推荐的工具集，它把 Redux 的最佳实践封装成开箱即用的 API，大幅削减样板代码，并内置 Immer 支持不可变更新。<code>createSlice</code> 统一定义 reducer 与 action，RTK Query 负责声明式数据获取与缓存，Entity Adapter 管理规范化状态。本章讲解这些能力及 configureStore 的中间件集成，说明 RTK 为何适合中大型应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rtk-概述\">RTK 概述</h2><p><strong>Redux Toolkit（RTK）</strong> 是 Redux 官方推荐的工具集，封装了 Redux 的最佳实践，大幅减少样板代码。它内置 Immer（不可变更新）、自动 action creator、以及 <code>createAsyncThunk</code> 处理异步逻辑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[UI 触发 Action] --&gt; B[Middleware]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Reducer 处理]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Store 更新]&#10;    D --&gt; E[useSelector 通知组件]&#10;    E --&gt; F[UI 重渲染]\">flowchart LR\n    A[UI 触发 Action] --&gt; B[Middleware]\n    B --&gt; C[Reducer 处理]\n    C --&gt; D[Store 更新]\n    D --&gt; E[useSelector 通知组件]\n    E --&gt; F[UI 重渲染]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"createslice\">createSlice</h2><p><code>createSlice</code> 是 RTK 的核心 API，集成了 reducer、action creator、action type 的定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { createSlice, PayloadAction } from &#39;@reduxjs/toolkit&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface Todo {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  text: string;&#10;  completed: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TodoState {&#10;  items: Todo[];&#10;  filter: &#39;all&#39; | &#39;active&#39; | &#39;completed&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const initialState: TodoState = {&#10;  items: [],&#10;  filter: &#39;all&#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;const todoSlice = createSlice({&#10;  name: &#39;todos&#39;,&#10;  initialState,&#10;  reducers: {&#10;    addTodo: {&#10;      reducer(state, action: PayloadAction&lt;Todo&gt;) {&#10;        state.items.push(action.payload);&#10;      },&#10;      prepare(text: string) {&#10;        return { payload: { id: crypto.randomUUID(), text, completed: false } };&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;    toggleTodo(state, action: PayloadAction&lt;string&gt;) {&#10;      const todo = state.items.find((t) =&gt; t.id === action.payload);&#10;      if (todo) {&#10;        todo.completed = !todo.completed;&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    removeTodo(state, action: PayloadAction&lt;string&gt;) {&#10;      state.items = state.items.filter((t) =&gt; t.id !== action.payload);&#10;    },&#10;    setFilter(state, action: PayloadAction&lt;TodoState[&#39;filter&#39;]&gt;) {&#10;      state.filter = action.payload;&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const { addTodo, toggleTodo, removeTodo, setFilter } = todoSlice.actions;&#10;export default todoSlice.reducer;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { createSlice, PayloadAction } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Todo {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  text: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  completed: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface TodoState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items: Todo[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter: 'all' | 'active' | 'completed';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const initialState: TodoState = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter: 'all',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const todoSlice = createSlice({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: 'todos',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  initialState,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reducers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    addTodo: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      reducer(state, action: PayloadAction&#x3C;Todo>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        state.items.push(action.payload);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      prepare(text: string) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return { payload: { id: crypto.randomUUID(), text, completed: false } };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    toggleTodo(state, action: PayloadAction&#x3C;string>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const todo = state.items.find((t) => t.id === action.payload);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (todo) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        todo.completed = !todo.completed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    removeTodo(state, action: PayloadAction&#x3C;string>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      state.items = state.items.filter((t) => t.id !== action.payload);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setFilter(state, action: PayloadAction&#x3C;TodoState['filter']>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      state.filter = action.payload;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const { addTodo, toggleTodo, removeTodo, setFilter } = todoSlice.actions;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default todoSlice.reducer;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> RTK 内置 Immer，在 reducer 中可以直接用 <code>state.items.push()</code> 这样的可变写法，Immer 会自动产生不可变更新。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rtk-query\">RTK Query</h2><p>RTK Query 是内置在 RTK 中的数据获取和缓存方案，提供了自动缓存、失效、重试等能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { createApi, fetchBaseQuery } from &#39;@reduxjs/toolkit/query/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface User {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  email: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const userApi = createApi({&#10;  reducerPath: &#39;userApi&#39;,&#10;  baseQuery: fetchBaseQuery({ baseUrl: &#39;/api&#39; }),&#10;  tagTypes: [&#39;User&#39;],&#10;  endpoints: (builder) =&gt; ({&#10;    getUsers: builder.query&lt;User[], void&gt;({&#10;      query: () =&gt; &#39;/users&#39;,&#10;      providesTags: (result) =&gt;&#10;        result&#10;          ? [...result.map(({ id }) =&gt; ({ type: &#39;User&#39; as const, id })), { type: &#39;User&#39;, id: &#39;LIST&#39; }]&#10;          : [{ type: &#39;User&#39;, id: &#39;LIST&#39; }],&#10;    }),&#10;    getUserById: builder.query&lt;User, string&gt;({&#10;      query: (id) =&gt; `/users/${id}`,&#10;      providesTags: (result, error, id) =&gt; [{ type: &#39;User&#39;, id }],&#10;    }),&#10;    createUser: builder.mutation&lt;User, Omit&lt;User, &#39;id&#39;&gt;&gt;({&#10;      query: (body) =&gt; ({&#10;        url: &#39;/users&#39;,&#10;        method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;        body,&#10;      }),&#10;      invalidatesTags: [{ type: &#39;User&#39;, id: &#39;LIST&#39; }],&#10;    }),&#10;    updateUser: builder.mutation&lt;User, Partial&lt;User&gt; &amp; Pick&lt;User, &#39;id&#39;&gt;&gt;({&#10;      query: ({ id, ...body }) =&gt; ({&#10;        url: `/users/${id}`,&#10;        method: &#39;PATCH&#39;,&#10;        body,&#10;      }),&#10;      invalidatesTags: (result, error, { id }) =&gt; [{ type: &#39;User&#39;, id }],&#10;    }),&#10;  }),&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const { useGetUsersQuery, useGetUserByIdQuery, useCreateUserMutation, useUpdateUserMutation } = userApi;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { createApi, fetchBaseQuery } from '@reduxjs/toolkit/query/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  email: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const userApi = createApi({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reducerPath: 'userApi',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  baseQuery: fetchBaseQuery({ baseUrl: '/api' }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tagTypes: ['User'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  endpoints: (builder) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    getUsers: builder.query&#x3C;User[], void>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      query: () => '/users',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      providesTags: (result) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ? [...result.map(({ id }) => ({ type: 'User' as const, id })), { type: 'User', id: 'LIST' }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          : [{ type: 'User', id: 'LIST' }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    getUserById: builder.query&#x3C;User, string>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      query: (id) => `/users/${id}`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      providesTags: (result, error, id) => [{ type: 'User', id }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    createUser: builder.mutation&#x3C;User, Omit&#x3C;User, 'id'>>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      query: (body) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        url: '/users',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        method: 'POST',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      invalidatesTags: [{ type: 'User', id: 'LIST' }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    updateUser: builder.mutation&#x3C;User, Partial&#x3C;User> &#x26; Pick&#x3C;User, 'id'>>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      query: ({ id, ...body }) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        url: `/users/${id}`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        method: 'PATCH',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      invalidatesTags: (result, error, { id }) => [{ type: 'User', id }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const { useGetUsersQuery, useGetUserByIdQuery, useCreateUserMutation, useUpdateUserMutation } = userApi;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[组件调用 useGetUsersQuery] --&gt; B{缓存中有数据?}&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; C[返回缓存数据]&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; D[发起网络请求]&#10;    D --&gt; E[存入缓存]&#10;    E --&gt; C&#10;    F[调用 createUser mutation] --&gt; G[invalidatesTags: User LIST]&#10;    G --&gt; H[自动重新获取 getUsers]\">flowchart TD\n    A[组件调用 useGetUsersQuery] --&gt; B{缓存中有数据?}\n    B -- 是 --&gt; C[返回缓存数据]\n    B -- 否 --&gt; D[发起网络请求]\n    D --&gt; E[存入缓存]\n    E --&gt; C\n    F[调用 createUser mutation] --&gt; G[invalidatesTags: User LIST]\n    G --&gt; H[自动重新获取 getUsers]</pre><p>在组件中使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function UserList() {&#10;  const { data: users, isLoading, error } = useGetUsersQuery();&#10;  const [createUser, { isLoading: isCreating }] = useCreateUserMutation();&#10;&#10;  if (isLoading) return &lt;Spinner /&gt;;&#10;  if (error) return &lt;ErrorMessage /&gt;;&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; createUser({ name: &#39;New User&#39;, email: &#39;new@example.com&#39; })} disabled={isCreating}&gt;&#10;        添加用户&#10;      &lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;ul&gt;&#10;        {users?.map((user) =&gt; (&#10;          &lt;li key={user.id}&gt;{user.name}&lt;/li&gt;&#10;        ))}&#10;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function UserList() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { data: users, isLoading, error } = useGetUsersQuery();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [createUser, { isLoading: isCreating }] = useCreateUserMutation();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (isLoading) return &#x3C;Spinner />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (error) return &#x3C;ErrorMessage />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => createUser({ name: 'New User', email: 'new@example.com' })} disabled={isCreating}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        添加用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {users?.map((user) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;li key={user.id}>{user.name}&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"entity-adapter\">Entity Adapter</h2><p><code>createEntityAdapter</code> 提供标准化的 CRUD 操作，以 normalized 形式管理集合数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { createEntityAdapter, createSlice, PayloadAction } from &#39;@reduxjs/toolkit&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface Article {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  title: string;&#10;  content: string;&#10;  authorId: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const articlesAdapter = createEntityAdapter&lt;Article&gt;({&#10;  sortComparer: (a, b) =&gt; a.title.localeCompare(b.title),&#10;});&#10;&#10;const articlesSlice = createSlice({&#10;  name: &#39;articles&#39;,&#10;  initialState: articlesAdapter.getInitialState({&#10;    loading: false,&#10;  }),&#10;  reducers: {&#10;    addArticle: articlesAdapter.addOne,&#10;    updateArticle: articlesAdapter.updateOne,&#10;    removeArticle: articlesAdapter.removeOne,&#10;    setAllArticles: articlesAdapter.setAll,&#10;    setLoading(state, action: PayloadAction&lt;boolean&gt;) {&#10;      state.loading = action.payload;&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const articleSelectors = articlesAdapter.getSelectors((state: RootState) =&gt; state.articles);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { createEntityAdapter, createSlice, PayloadAction } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  content: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  authorId: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const articlesAdapter = createEntityAdapter&#x3C;Article>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sortComparer: (a, b) => a.title.localeCompare(b.title),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const articlesSlice = createSlice({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: 'articles',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  initialState: articlesAdapter.getInitialState({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loading: false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reducers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    addArticle: articlesAdapter.addOne,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    updateArticle: articlesAdapter.updateOne,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    removeArticle: articlesAdapter.removeOne,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setAllArticles: articlesAdapter.setAll,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setLoading(state, action: PayloadAction&#x3C;boolean>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      state.loading = action.payload;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const articleSelectors = articlesAdapter.getSelectors((state: RootState) => state.articles);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>addOne</code> / <code>addMany</code></td>\n<td>添加实体</td>\n<td>忽略已存在的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>setOne</code> / <code>setAll</code></td>\n<td>设置实体</td>\n<td>覆盖已存在的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>updateOne</code> / <code>updateMany</code></td>\n<td>部分更新</td>\n<td>只修改指定字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>upsertOne</code> / <code>upsertMany</code></td>\n<td>插入或更新</td>\n<td>不存在则插入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>removeOne</code> / <code>removeMany</code></td>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>按 ID 移除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"normalized-state\">Normalized State</h2><p>Entity Adapter 使用 normalized state 结构，将数组转换为 <code>{ ids: [], entities: {} }</code> 的形式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 数组形式&#10;        A[[{id:1, name:&#39;A&#39;}, {id:2, name:&#39;B&#39;}]&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Normalized&#10;        B[ids: [1, 2]&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;entities: {1: {id:1, name:&#39;A&#39;}, 2: {id:2, name:&#39;B&#39;}}&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; B&#10;    A --&gt; C\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 数组形式\n        A[[{id:1, name:'A'}, {id:2, name:'B'}]\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Normalized\n        B[ids: [1, 2]\"]\n        C[\"entities: {1: {id:1, name:'A'}, 2: {id:2, name:'B'}}\"]\n    end\n    A --&gt; B\n    A --&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>数组</th>\n<th>Normalized</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按 ID 查找</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插入</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保持顺序</td>\n<td>天然有序</td>\n<td>ids 数组维护顺序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"middleware\">Middleware</h2><p>RTK 默认配置了 <code>redux-thunk</code> 和开发环境的序列化检查。可以添加自定义中间件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { configureStore } from &#39;@reduxjs/toolkit&#39;;&#10;&#10;const loggerMiddleware: Middleware = (storeApi) =&gt; (next) =&gt; (action) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;dispatching&#39;, action);&#10;  const result = next(action);&#10;  console.log(&#39;next state&#39;, storeApi.getState());&#10;  return result;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const store = configureStore({&#10;  reducer: {&#10;    todos: todoSlice.reducer,&#10;    articles: articlesSlice.reducer,&#10;    [userApi.reducerPath]: userApi.reducer,&#10;  },&#10;  middleware: (getDefaultMiddleware) =&gt; getDefaultMiddleware().concat(userApi.middleware).concat(loggerMiddleware),&#10;});&#10;&#10;export type RootState = ReturnType&lt;typeof store.getState&gt;;&#10;export type AppDispatch = typeof store.dispatch;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { configureStore } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const loggerMiddleware: Middleware = (storeApi) => (next) => (action) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('dispatching', action);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const result = next(action);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('next state', storeApi.getState());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const store = configureStore({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reducer: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    todos: todoSlice.reducer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    articles: articlesSlice.reducer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [userApi.reducerPath]: userApi.reducer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  middleware: (getDefaultMiddleware) => getDefaultMiddleware().concat(userApi.middleware).concat(loggerMiddleware),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export type RootState = ReturnType&#x3C;typeof store.getState>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export type AppDispatch = typeof store.dispatch;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 RTK Query 时必须将其 middleware 添加到 store 配置中，否则缓存失效和轮询等功能不会工作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>createSlice</strong> 将 reducer、action creator、action type 统一定义，内置 Immer 支持可变写法</li>\n<li><strong>RTK Query</strong> 提供声明式数据获取，自动管理缓存、失效、重试，通过 tags 实现缓存关联</li>\n<li><strong>Entity Adapter</strong> 提供 normalized state 管理，CRUD 操作 O(1) 时间复杂度</li>\n<li>configureStore 自动集成 thunk 中间件和开发检查，支持扩展自定义中间件</li>\n<li>RTK 适合中到大型应用，生态丰富，与 TypeScript 集成完善</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Redux Toolkit 状态管理工具集","id":"redux-toolkit-状态管理工具集"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"RTK 概述","id":"rtk-概述"},{"level":2,"text":"createSlice","id":"createslice"},{"level":2,"text":"RTK Query","id":"rtk-query"},{"level":2,"text":"Entity Adapter","id":"entity-adapter"},{"level":2,"text":"Normalized State","id":"normalized-state"},{"level":2,"text":"Middleware","id":"middleware"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Zustand 状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/zustand"},"next":{"title":"Jotai 与 Signals","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/jotai-and-signals"}}